{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788619875090,"sessionID":"ses_f8df59422ffeuY8ct2HDJCCEpY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_e9909i3SiHMVd1kZjpo37OrJ","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review/deep-review-strategy.md","offset":1,"limit":500},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review/deep-review-strategy.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: Deep Review Strategy\n3: description: Lineage-local review strategy for the scripts-to-runtime nesting packet.\n4: version: 1.11.0.13\n5: ---\n6: \n7: # Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n8: \n9: ## 1. OVERVIEW\n10: \n11: This strategy tracks the ten required inline passes. The review is bounded by `scratch/review-scope.txt`; convergence is telemetry only because the stop policy is `max-iterations`.\n12: \n13: ## 2. TOPIC\n14: \n15: Review of `.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting` and its declared 420-file scope.\n16: \n17: <!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n18: ## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n19: - [ ] correctness\n20: - [ ] security\n21: - [ ] traceability\n22: - [ ] maintainability\n23: \n24: <!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n25: \n26: ## 4. NON-GOALS\n27: \n28: - No source, target spec, generated repository artifact, git state, or external service changes.\n29: - No execution of repository validation or test commands that may write outside this lineage.\n30: - No resource-map coverage gate because no resource map existed at initialization.\n31: \n32: ## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n33: \n34: The workflow runs all ten iterations. A pause sentinel, malformed canonical state