{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788619896850,"sessionID":"ses_f8df59422ffeuY8ct2HDJCCEpY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_mTnnau7FriIajFBewPdaqpZC","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"system-spec-kit/scripts|scripts/dist|scripts/memory|dist/memory|@spec-kit/scripts|runtime/cli|continuity","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit","include":"*.{json,md,ts,js,mjs,cjs,sh,yml,yaml}"},"output":"Found 100 matches (more matches available)\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:\n  Line 77: bash .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh --level 1 --path specs/###-name --name feature-name\n\n  Line 82: bash .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh --level 2 --path specs/###-name --name feature-name\n\n  Line 87: bash .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh --level 3 --path specs/###-name --name feature-name\n\n  Line 90: bash .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/templates/inline-gate-renderer.sh \\\n\n  Line 98: bash .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh --level 3+ --path specs/###-name --name feature-name\n\n  Line 101: bash .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/templates/inline-gate-renderer.sh \\\n\n  Line 135: └── implementation-summary.md    (REQUIRED - from implementation-summary.md, carries `_memory.continuity`)\n\n  Line 252: Generated continuity artifacts in `memory/` folders MUST use paired anchors for semantic indexing:\n\n  Line 272: **Generation:** Use `/speckit:save` or `node .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dist/continuity/generate-context.js --json '{\"specFolder\":\"###-name\",\"sessionSummary\":\"...\"}' specs/###-name/` to update the packet's canonical continuity surfaces, primarily `_memory.continuity` inside `implementation-summary.md`.\n\n  Line 315: bash .openc