 than the root test gate.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"producer_consumer_trace\",\"queryOrPath\":\"package scripts to Vitest config paths\",\"result\":\"CLI package uses ../vitest.config.ts; root config owns a separate CLI project; runtime config excludes cli.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"runtime/cli/package.json:18-21\",\"vitest.config.ts:19-57\",\"runtime/vitest.config.ts:20-23\"]}],\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"rationale\":\"The repository exposes multiple config owners without a direct proof that the package command covers the root project's CLI suite.\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"F001\"},{\"id\":\"SL-003\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"targetRefs\":[\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/README.md\"],\"bugClass\":\"stale_topology_docs\",\"hypothesis\":\"Moved package docs still teach the retired source tree.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"exact_grep\",\"queryOrPath\":\"README.md for scripts/ and memory/ topology\",\"result\":\"Topology block lists scripts/ and memory/ despite runtime/cli and continuity paths.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"runtime/cli/README.md:56-98\"]}],\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"rationale\":\"Persistent package documentation remains inconsistent with the current layout.\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"F002\"}]},\"sessionId\":\"fanout-luna-max-review-2-1788619675959-m55pwa\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-05T15:05:00Z\",\"durationMs\":300000}\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deep-review-state.jsonl","relativePath":".opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deep-review-state.jsonl","type":"update","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts