 cwd assumptions.\",\"recommendation\":\"Keep the test-only override restriction and add source/dist candidate coverage.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"test-isolation\",\"scopeProof\":\"Read the candidate resolver and its environment-mode guard.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"session stop autosave\",\"path resolution\"],\"content_hash\":\"f004-security-stop-hook-candidates\"}],\"newFindingsRatio\":0.3,\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"summary\":{\"required\":2,\"executed\":2,\"pass\":0,\"partial\":2,\"fail\":0,\"blocked\":0,\"notApplicable\":0,\"gatingFailures\":0},\"results\":[{\"protocolId\":\"spec_code\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"gateClass\":\"hard\",\"applicable\":true,\"counts\":{\"pass\":0,\"partial\":1,\"fail\":0,\"skipped\":0},\"evidence\":[\"spec.md:42-45\",\"factory.ts:243-255\"],\"findingRefs\":[\"F003\"],\"summary\":\"Shared root discovery still encodes the retired sibling name.\"},{\"protocolId\":\"checklist_evidence\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"gateClass\":\"hard\",\"applicable\":true,\"counts\":{\"pass\":0,\"partial\":1,\"fail\":0,\"skipped\":0},\"evidence\":[\"tasks.md:47-60\",\"factory.ts:243-255\"],\"findingRefs\":[\"F003\"],\"summary\":\"Path work is recorded, but this producer lacks current-layout evidence.\"},{\"protocolId\":\"feature_catalog_code\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"gateClass\":\"advisory\",\"applicable\":true,\"counts\":{\"pass\":1,\"partial\":0,\"fail\":0,\"skipped\":0},\"evidence\":[\"session-stop.ts:61-76\"],\"findingRefs\":[],\"summary\":\"Hook override is test-gated and candidate order is explicit.\"},{\"protocolId\":\"playbook_capability\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"gateClass\":\"advisory\",\"applicable\":true,\"counts\":{\"pass\":0,\"partial\":1,\"fail\":0,\"skipped\":0},\"evidence\":[\"session-stop.ts:71-89\"],\"findingRefs\":[\"F004\"],\"summary\":\"Candidate-depth behavior lacks a replayable path test in the inspected scope.\"}]},\"reviewDepthSchemaVersion\":2,\"reviewDepthApplicability\":{\"scopeClass\":\"complex\",\"enforcem