d.\n+- Convergence was not used as a terminal condition. The configured max-iterations ceiling controls synthesis.\n+\n+## Dead Ends\n+- Repository validation, builds, tests, graph writes and continuity generation were intentionally not run because they could write outside the lineage directory.\n+\n+## Recommended Next Focus\n+Synthesize the canonical report and leave implementation remediation to a separate workflow.\n+\n+Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n\nIndex: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":10,\"iteration\":10,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"final-stabilization\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\",\"security\",\"traceability\",\"maintainability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\"active finding anchors and packet evidence\"],\"findingsCount\":12,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":5,\"P2\":7},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":0},\"findingsRefined\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":5,\"P2\":7},\"findingRefs\":[\"F001\",\"F003\",\"F005\",\"F006\",\"F007\",\"F002\",\"F004\",\"F008\",\"F009\",\"F010\",\"F011\",\"F012\"],\"findingDetails\":[],\"newFindingsRatio\":0,\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"summary\":{\"required\":2,\"executed\":2,\"pass\":0,\"partial\":1,\"fail\":1,\"blocked\":0,\"notApplicable\":0,\"gatingFailures\":1},\"results\"