and was run.\n+\n+## Recommended Next Focus\n+Correctness and traceability final rescan of all active findings, with no new implementation assumptions.\n+\n+Review verdict: PASS\n","additions":40,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-008.jsonl","relativePath":" .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-008.jsonl","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-008.jsonl\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-008.jsonl\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-008.jsonl\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":8,\"iteration\":8,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"maintainability-final-surface-sweep\",\"dimensions\":[\"maintainability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/templates/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/loaders/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/optimizer/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/README.md\"],\"findingsCoun