rrent manifests, resolver producers, helper files and linked documentation.\n+\n+## Scorecard\n+- Dimensions covered: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n+- Files reviewed: 15 direct files plus all active finding anchors\n+- New findings: P0=0 P1=0 P2=0\n+- Refined findings: P0=0 P1=4 P2=4\n+- New findings ratio: 0.00\n+\n+## Findings\n+No new findings. Active F001, F003, F005, F006 and F007 were re-read and remain supported. F002, F004, F008, F009, F010, F011 and F012 remain advisory or verification findings.\n+\n+## Cross-Reference Results\n+| Protocol | Status | Gate | Evidence | Notes |\n+|----------|--------|------|----------|-------|\n+| spec_code | partial | hard | package.json:6-25; factory.ts:243-255; spec.md:23-32 | Active P1 findings remain. |\n+| checklist_evidence | fail | hard | acceptance-criteria.md:58-63; plan.md:45-48 | Packet state and evidence are not reconciled. |\n+| feature_catalog_code | partial | advisory | SKILL.md:103; runtime/cli README family | Current and retired labels coexist. |\n+| playbook_capability | fail | advisory | manual playbook:52-116; session coverage:99-135 | Recorded replay commands still use old paths. |\n+\n+## Assessment\n+- New findings ratio: 0.00\n+- Dimensions addressed: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n+- Novelty justification: adversarial replay found no unsupported downgrade or new defect class.\n+\n+## Ruled Out\n+- The earlier missing nested-manifest hypothesis is false in the current tree. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/package.json:1-34]\n+- The earlier old CI guard-path hypothesis is false for the two inspected guard workflows. [SOURCE: .github/workflows/markdown-link-integrity.yml:26-37] [SOURCE: .github/workflows/command-tree-parity.yml:19-33]\n+\n+## Dead Ends\n+- No external commands were run.\n+\n+## Recommended Next Focus\n+Final all-dimension stabilization pass and synthesis. Do not stop early because max-iterations is the configured terminal policy.\n+\n+Review verdict: PASS\n","additions":39,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-009.jsonl","relativePath":" .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-009.jsonl","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-009.jsonl\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-009.jsonl\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-009.jsonl\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":9,\"iteration\":9,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"adversarial-correctness-rescan\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\",\"security\",\"traceability\",\"maintainability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/package.json\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/package.json\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vitest.config.ts\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/embeddings/factory.ts\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/session-stop.ts\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/README.md\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/.scan-one-fast.sh\",\".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/