iew/lineages/luna-max-review-2/iterations/iteration-010.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/iterations/iteration-010.md\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/iterations/iteration-010.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@\n+# Iteration 10: Final Stabilization and Synthesis Readiness\n+\n+## Focus\n+Final all-dimension stabilization pass. Findings, protocol results and current source citations were re-read before synthesis. No early convergence stop was taken.\n+\n+## Scorecard\n+- Dimensions covered: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n+- Files reviewed: active finding anchors and packet evidence\n+- New findings: P0=0 P1=0 P2=0\n+- Refined findings: P0=0 P1=5 P2=7\n+- New findings ratio: 0.00\n+\n+## Findings\n+No new findings. The active finding set remains F001, F003, F005, F006 and F007 at P1, with F002, F004, F008, F009, F010, F011 and F012 as P2 or verification advisories.\n+\n+## Cross-Reference Results\n+| Protocol | Status | Gate | Evidence | Notes |\n+|----------|--------|------|----------|-------|\n+| spec_code | partial | hard | package.json:6-25; factory.ts:243-255; spec.md:23-32 | Five P1 findings remain active. |\n+| checklist_evidence | fail | hard | acceptance-criteria.md:58-63; plan.md:45-48 | Completion evidence is not reconciled. |\n+| feature_catalog_code | partial | advisory | SKILL.md:103; runtime/cli README family | Stale path labels remain. |\n+| playbook_capability | fail | advisory | manual playbook:52-116 | Recorded commands use retired paths. |\n+\n+## Assessment\n+- New findings ratio: 0.00\n+- Dimensions addressed: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n+- Novelty justification: stabilization produced no new defect class and did not downgrade any active P1.\n+\n+## Ruled Out\n+- No P0 was confirmed after the final adversarial re-read.\n+- Convergence was not used as a terminal condition. The configured max-iterations ceiling controls synthesis.\n+\n+## Dead Ends\n+- Repository validation, builds, tests, graph writes and continuity generation were intentionally not run because they could write outside the lineage directory.\n+\n+## Recommended Next Focus\n+Synthesize the canonical report and leave implementation remediation to a separate workflow.\n+\n+Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n","additions":39,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-010.jsonl","relativePath":" .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-010.jsonl","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/ .opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-2/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"run\":10,\"iteration\":10,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"final-stabilization\",